Subject: Re: Vectorized distributions
Message-ID: <3Qd0ltjs9Pk.b_HQyKGn6ecJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <3Qd0ltjs9Pk.Z3F68frr22sJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <3Qd0ltjs9Pk.Z3F68frr22sJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
