Actually, check_positive_definite is currently not being called at all:

goodrich@CYBERPOWERPC:/opt/stan$ git grep -n "check_pos_definite" src/stan/ | cat
src/stan/agrad/matrix.hpp:1980:    inline bool check_pos_definite(const char* function,
