We do check for positive definiteness in multi_normal and multi_student_t, but as part of the density evaluation rather than a separate call to check_pos_definite(). It is a shame that fixed matrices get checked every time the density is evaluated, but I am not sure there is much we can do about it with the Stan 1.0.x design.

