As I said, if the line of resetting the seed is commented out, RStan and Stan would be the same.
I have that line of for the purpose it would be reproducible if we take the inits from a previous run and feed the same seed.
So I would propose to add that line in Stan so that we would have the same results in Stan and RStan.  Of course, I can be convinced to get rid of that line.

And comparing the results from Stan and RStan if that line is commented out, we need to be careful that the data dumped to Stan
are different from that directly passed to Stan in RStan as R dump would round the data.

