I've tested command-line Stan:

   Stan 1.0.2   Clang-LLVM  Xcode 4.5.1    Mountain Lion
   Stan 1.0.2   GCC-LLVM    Xcode 4.5.1    Mountain Lion

both with our own Boost and Eigen lib versions.

I've tested RStan:

   RStan 1.0.2  GCC-LLVM    Xcode 4.5.1    Mountain Lion    R 2.15.1 64-bit

with whatever lib versions it comes with.

Are there other relevant parameters to list?

- Bob

