Subject: emacs mode (not yet finished, but in the repository)
Message-ID: <zczEi8CumSA._fV34IHM0dYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/zczEi8CumSA/m/_fV34IHM0dYJ>
