Subject: meta-traits issue
Message-ID: <YUsm14DVtMA.OQBYMK6FteUJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/YUsm14DVtMA/m/OQBYMK6FteUJ>
