On 10/28/12 3:04 PM, Marcus Brubaker wrote:
> One option is to template out the range checking in the indexing functions and percolate that up to debug and non-debug
> versions of log_prob.  Then the debug version is called once at the beginning and everything else uses the non-debug
> versions.
